ed question contract (```question fence)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/aidlc-common/protocols/stage-protocol.md", "source_location": "L88", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Question fences are authoring specs rendered through the harness annex (native tool or numbered prose), never echoed verbatim; option labels like Approve/Request Changes/Accept as-is stay English."}, {"id": "claude_aidlc_common_protocols_stage_protocol_critical_compliance_checklist", "label": "Critical Compliance Checklist", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/aidlc-common/protocols/stage-protocol.md", "source_location": "L128", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_aidlc_common_protocols_stage_protocol_approval_gates", "label": "Approval gates", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/aidlc-common/protocols/stage-protocol.md", "source_location": "L139", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every non-initialization stage requires explicit user approval; gates cannot be inferred or auto-approved."}, {"id": "claude_aidlc_common_protocols_stage_protocol_hard_stop_rule", "label": "HARD STOP rule at approval gates", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/aidlc-common/protocols/stage-protocol.md", "source_location": "L143", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_aidlc_common_protocols_stage_protocol_no_emergent_behavior_rule", "label": "NO EMERGENT BEHAVIOR rule (2-option gates)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/aidlc-common/protocols/stage-protocol.md", "source_location": "L147", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Construction/Operation gates are strictly Approve / Request Changes; only Ideation/Inception may add a third 'Add skipped stage' option. Ca